        <div>
          <p>
            I served as the <strong>field leader for a six-person surveying team</strong>. I was
            responsible for coordinating the field workflow, organizing the measurement sequence,
            helping the team maintain consistent instrument setup and observation procedures, and
            keeping the field work organized and efficient.
